{
  "slug": "agent-advisor",
  "name": "Agent Advisor",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "Real-time dashboard showing Claude Code subagent status and activity\nAnalyze their performances and offer improvements",
  "longDescription": "Ships **3 skills**, **7 agents**, **2 commands** and **9 hooks**.\n\n- **Skills** (3): `advisor` (Analyze subagent performance metrics and project context to suggest new agents or improvements to existing ones), `dashboard` (Start the Agent Dashboard server and open the real-time subagent status visualizer), `review-workflow` (Run QA then code review on recent changes)\n- **Agents** (7): `code-review-agent` (Use as the final step after QA to validate that ALL original requirements were fully implemented with no…), `docs-agent` (Use for ALL documentation maintenance — keeping README.md, CHANGELOG.md, docs/ folder, and CLAUDE.md accurate and in sync with…), `preview-tester` (Use for verifying UI changes in the browser preview), `product-agent` (Use for feature research, requirements analysis, and scope definition), `qa-agent` (Use for quality assurance after feature implementation — runs server checks, console error checks, and browser preview validation), `research-agent` (Use for web research, documentation lookups, and API exploration), `test-runner` (Use for running and managing automated tests)\n- **Commands** (2): `commit-push` (Stage, commit, and push local changes with a conventional commit message), `full-review`\n- **Hooks** (9): `SubagentStart`, `SubagentStop`, `PreToolUse`, `PostToolUse`, `PostToolUseFailure`, `Stop`, `Notification`, `SessionStart`, and 1 more\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install agent-advisor@claude-community` from `cfirz/agent-advisor`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude"
  ],
  "pluginType": "package",
